---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const faqSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is the Peanut Buster Parfait at DQ?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "The Peanut Buster® Parfait ($4.99, 710 cal) is alternating layers of DQ soft serve, salted roasted peanuts, and hot fudge sauce served in a parfait cup. It has been on the DQ menu since 1968 and is one of the longest-running items in fast food history."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is the DQ Banana Split?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "The DQ Banana Split ($5.69, 560 cal) features a fresh split banana topped with three scoops of DQ soft serve, pineapple topping, strawberry topping, and hot fudge, finished with whipped topping and a maraschino cherry. It is comfortably shareable between two people."
      }
    }
  ]
};
---
<Layout title="Dairy Queen Classic Treats Menu & Prices 2026 — Cones, Sundaes, Parfaits & Novelties | The Queen Dairy Menu" description="Complete DQ Classic Treats menu with 2026 prices. Vanilla cone $2.39, Peanut Buster Parfait $4.99, Banana Split $5.69, Dilly Bars, Cupfections and sundaes with calories.">
<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faqSchema)} />


<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="breadcrumb">
<div class="container"><ol>
<li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
<li><a href="/#full-menu">Menu</a></li>
<li aria-current="page">DQ Classic Treats 2026</li>
</ol></div>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
<div class="container">
<div class="hero-content">
<span class="hero-eyebrow">Est. 1940 · The Original American Soft Serve</span>
<h1>DQ Classic Treats 2026</h1>
</div>
</div>
</section>

  
<!-- AdX: before content -->
<div id="div-gpt-ad-thequeendairymenu_us-before_content">
  <script>
    googletag.cmd.push(function() { googletag.display('div-gpt-ad-thequeendairymenu_us-before_content'); });
  </script>
</div>

<section class="section"><div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>DQ Classic Treats — Complete 2026 Menu</h2>
    <p>Before the Blizzard, there was the DQ soft serve cone. Since 1940, the <strong>Dairy Queen vanilla soft serve cone</strong> has been the foundation of the entire brand. At $2.39, it remains the best-value treat on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>. The Classic Treats category covers everything from cones and sundaes to the iconic Peanut Buster Parfait, Banana Split, Dilly Bars, and the premium Cupfection lineup.</p>
