    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What is the Peanut Buster Parfait at DQ?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">The Peanut Buster® Parfait ($4.99, 710 cal) is alternating layers of DQ soft serve, salted roasted peanuts, and hot fudge sauce served in a parfait cup. It has been on the DQ menu since 1968 and is one of the longest-running items in fast food history.</div></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What is the DQ Banana Split?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">The DQ Banana Split ($5.69, 560 cal) features a fresh split banana topped with three scoops of DQ soft serve, pineapple topping, strawberry topping, and hot fudge, finished with whipped topping and a maraschino cherry. It is comfortably shareable between two people.</div></div></div>
